  "description": "Microsoft.O365.Security.ETW is a pure .NET ETW consumer for Windows, with compatibility-oriented APIs and an allocation-free EventRecordRef reading surface. It calls ETW and TDH directly without a C++/CLI or mixed-mode assembly dependency.",
  "id": "Microsoft.O365.Security.ETW",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-06T23:08:30.817Z",
