  "published": "2026-11-06T23:01:28.037Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 5.0.0:\n        - Replaces the C++/CLI wrapper with a pure .NET implementation. The C++/CLI package\n          Microsoft.O365.Security.Native.ETW remains a separate 4.x package.\n        - Adds an allocation-free EventRecordRef reading surface. Materializing strings,\n          arrays and other objects may allocate.\n        - No C++/CLI or mixed-mode assembly dependency; one AnyCPU assembly serves x64 and ARM64.\n        - Targets net462, net48, net8.0-windows and net10.0-windows.\n        - The namespace (Microsoft.O365.Security.ETW) is unchanged, but the public surface is\n          only partially source-compatible, with no binary compatibility. Rebuild all consumers\n          and review the breaking-change checklists:\n          https://github.com/microsoft/krabsetw/blob/master/managed/MIGRATION.md",
